From: webOS Security Patches
Subject: [PATCH 005] RTL text rendering use-after-free fix
Date: 2025-01-01

This patch addresses CVE-2010-0049, a use-after-free vulnerability
in WebKit's handling of right-to-left (RTL) text directionality
that could allow remote code execution.

The vulnerability occurs when HTML elements with RTL text
directionality are manipulated, causing child elements to be
freed while still referenced.

---
